    "link": {
      "$description": "Preset 7964ex (used by footer links) declares no font-family/size/line-height/weight of its own — it is inherit-only, only setting text-decoration:none. It is NOT one of the 11 type-scale steps; recorded here for audit completeness only, as instructed by the design spec. It intentionally has no $value/$type because it carries no scale-relevant design value.",
